text_representativeness":0.9427295327186584,"text_excerpt":"I am by no means a coffee connoisseur. However, I do pound down 40 ounces of hot coffee every morning at my desk. But what's even more enjoyable to me is the occasional iced coffees I try at different coffee shops around the city. And I'm fortunate enough that my current job has me out and about several times a week which gives me the opportunity to strategically pass by coffee shops that I have Yelped. I finally got to try Church Alley Coffee a few days ago. Little did I know that this shop was less than 1/2 mile from my office. As soon as I opened the front door I was taken back at how cool the decor was. The owner, Renee, was also the barista, and she was extremely friendly. She origin..."},{"business_id":"4PY2rKHXo7DsRdHvJNwAvA","review_id":"Ze2Tc8KoHoy9aWe50XyRjQ","date":"2013-07-09T03:39:39","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9343335032463074,"text_excerpt":"I love this place. The pour over coffee is amazing, the advice from the barista is right on, and its gorgeous inside and out. I came by in the afternoon and enjoyed a cup on the way home from school. I would love to come back for reading or work. Now, don't get my wrong, the coffee is strong, but that is just how I like it. The only note that I would make is that the area is ultra sketchy. That just means, parks as close as you can and lock your door."},{"business_id":"4PY2rKHXo7DsRdHvJNwAvA","review_id":"loKrcjIeTec16n5t0_XS-A","date":"2014-02-19T00:47:34","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9317449927330017,"text_excerpt":"Edit: Went to the new location. It's still quiet and has potential as a study spot. Coffee was decent, although pricey. None of the staff seemed to know how the food worked, though, which made trying to order any a confusing experience. I find the new setup a little uncomfortable: long rows of tables with chairs on each side. Still has some kinks to be worked out, apparently. This place is good! I've fallen out of the habit of caring about my coffee and its provenance since moving to New Orleans. This place reminds me a little bit of my days in San Francisco. That alone is not enough though, because really, I'm a philistine who will drink coffee anything. What I really like about this pla..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"4PY2rKHXo7DsRdHvJNwAvA","photo_id":"fJ92WlBOl7BZXdTZBwS9Bg","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/fJ92WlBOl7BZXdTZBwS9Bg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8779980540275574},{"business_id":"4PY2rKHXo7DsRdHvJNwAvA","photo_id":"hEngnAZOOYtCYIfFK-BBpw","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/hEngnAZOOYtCYIfFK-BBpw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8759703636169434},{"business_id":"4PY2rKHXo7DsRdHvJNwAvA","photo_id":"xK4lNdPB6hJYooWgCrxIjQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/xK4lNdPB6hJYooWgCrxIjQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8477432131767273},{"business_id":"4PY2rKHXo7DsRdHvJNwAvA","photo_id":"9cI6IeeQOM4wC1UiTzGnBA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/9cI6IeeQOM4wC1UiTzGnBA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8462201952934265},{"business_id":"4PY2rKHXo7DsRdHvJNwAvA","photo_id":"5tLVm9GtbYE03QjJW1B3Aw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/5tLVm9GtbYE03QjJW1B3Aw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8057492971420288}]},"notebook_case":null}
